## 2. Sea-Ice Motion

### NSIDC Polar Pathfinder Daily Sea Ice Motion Vectors
- **Dataset name:** Polar Pathfinder Daily 25 km EASE-Grid Sea Ice Motion Vectors, Version 4
- **Provider:** National Snow and Ice Data Center (NSIDC) / NASA Distributed Active Archive Center (DAAC)
- **URL:** https://nsidc.org/data/nsidc-0116 (DOI: [10.5067/INAWUWO7QHCT](https://doi.org/10.5067/INAWUWO7QHCT))
- **License:** Open Access (NASA Earth Science Open Data Policy)
- **Spatial resolution:** 25 km $\times$ 25 km
- **Temporal resolution:** Daily
- **Coordinate system:** NSIDC South Polar Stereographic (EPSG:3412) / EASE-Grid South
- **Variables:**
  - `u`: Eastward component of sea-ice motion velocity
  - `v`: Northward component of sea-ice motion velocity
  - `flags`: Quality and source sensor indicator flags
- **Units:** Centimeters per second ($\text{cm/s}$), converted to meters per second ($\text{m/s}$)
- **Missing-data representation:** `-9999.0` or standard NetCDF `_FillValue`
- **Processing performed:**
  1. Unit conversion from $\text{cm/s}$ to $\text{m/s}$ ($\times 10^{-2}$).
  2. Vector component rotation to align with EPSG:3031 projected grid axes ($U_{grid}, V_{grid}$).
  3. Bilinear interpolation onto the active navigation cost grid nodes.
- **Date downloaded:** *Not yet downloaded (Planned / Schema Defined)*

