## 4. Atmospheric / Wind Reanalysis & Forecasts

### ECMWF ERA5 Atmospheric Reanalysis
- **Dataset name:** ERA5 Reanalysis Single Levels (and ECMWF IFS HRES Operational Forecasts)
- **Provider:** European Centre for Medium-Range Weather Forecasts (ECMWF) / Copernicus Climate Change Service (C3S)
- **URL:** https://cds.climate.copernicus.eu/cdsapp#!/dataset/reanalysis-era5-single-levels
- **License:** Copernicus Open Access Licence (Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International - CC BY 4.0)
- **Spatial resolution:** 0.25° $\times$ 0.25° (approx. 27–31 km)
- **Temporal resolution:** Hourly
- **Coordinate system:** WGS84 Geographic Regular Lat/Lon grid (EPSG:4326)
- **Variables:**
  - `u10`: 10-meter eastward neutral wind velocity component
  - `v10`: 10-meter northward neutral wind velocity component
  - `msl`: Mean sea level atmospheric pressure
  - `t2m`: 2-meter air temperature
- **Units:**
  - Wind components (`u10`, `v10`): Meters per second ($\text{m/s}$)
  - Pressure (`msl`): Pascals ($\text{Pa}$)
  - Temperature (`t2m`): Kelvin ($\text{K}$)
- **Missing-data representation:** NetCDF `_FillValue = -32767` or `NaN`
- **Processing performed:**
  1. Southern latitude extraction ($-50^\circ\text{ S}$ to $-90^\circ\text{ S}$).
  2. Re-projection and grid-relative vector decomposition onto EPSG:3031.
  3. Computation of wind magnitude $|\mathbf{u}_{10}| = \sqrt{u_{10}^2 + v_{10}^2}$ and direction for aerodynamic drag calculations in iceberg drift models.
- **Date downloaded:** *Not yet downloaded (Planned / Schema Defined)*

